<div class="bg-gradient-cream min-h-screen text-dark leading-relaxed">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 bg-warm-white shadow-2xl rounded-3xl my-4 md:my-8 relative overflow-hidden border-2 border-cream results-container">
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12 pb-8 border-b-2 border-green relative header">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-green mb-2 drop-shadow-sm">Tus Resultados</h1>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-coral font-normal italic">Cuestionario de Descanso Consciente</h2>
      </div>

      <% if @predominant_tiredness %>
        <!-- Primary Result -->
        <div class="bg-coral-light/20 border-4 <%= @result_presenter.category_color_class(@predominant_tiredness) %> rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12 text-center shadow-xl relative">
          <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 mx-auto mb-8 shadow-lg max-w-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-2">
              <span class="text-3xl mr-3">🌸</span>
              <div class="text-center">
                <p class="text-lg font-bold text-dark"><%= @result_presenter.total_responses %> respuestas afirmativas</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">de cansancio detectadas</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-4 text-dark">Tu tipo de cansancio predominante:</h3>
          <h4 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl mb-6 font-bold text-dark drop-shadow-sm"><%= @predominant_tiredness.name %></h4>
          <p class="text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-medium">
            <%= @result_presenter.recommendation_text(@predominant_tiredness) %>
          </p>
        </div>
      <% end %>

      <!-- Detailed Results -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-center text-dark mb-8 font-bold">Resultados Detallados</h3>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
          <% @result_presenter.sorted_categories.each do |category| %>
            <% score = @result_presenter.score_for(category) %>
            <% percentage = @result_presenter.percentage_for(category) %>
            
            <div class="bg-warm-white border-2 <%= @result_presenter.category_color_class(category) %> rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                <h4 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-dark"><%= category.name %></h4>
                <div class="px-4 py-2 rounded-3xl font-bold text-lg <%= @result_presenter.badge_color_class(category) %>">
                  <span class="text-xl"><%= score %></span>/<%= QuestionnaireResultPresenter::MAX_SCORE %>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="bg-cream h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6">
                <div class="<%= @result_presenter.progress_bar_color(category) %> h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-500" data-controller="progress-bar" data-width="<%= percentage %>"></div>
              </div>
              
              <p class="text-medium leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg">
                <%= @result_presenter.recommendation_text(category) %>
              </p>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Important Note -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-blue border-2 border-blue-500 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8 relative important-note">
        <h4 class="text-blue-800 text-xl md:text-2xl mb-4 font-bold">Nota importante</h4>
        <p class="text-blue-900 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg">
          Si el cansancio afecta profundamente tu calidad de vida y bienestar, 
          o si sentís que no lográs recuperarte a pesar de los descansos, 
          te recomendamos que busques el apoyo de un profesional de la salud. 
          Este cuestionario no reemplaza el consejo o tratamiento profesional.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Mailing List Benefits -->
      <div class="bg-green-50 border-2 border-green-200 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8 text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl mb-4">💌</div>
        <h4 class="text-green-800 text-xl md:text-2xl mb-4 font-bold">¿Te gustaría recibir más contenido sobre Descanso Consciente?</h4>
        <p class="text-green-700 mb-6">Al suscribirte recibirás:</p>
        <ul class="text-green-700 space-y-2 mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
          <li class="flex items-center justify-start">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3">•</span>
            <span>Información y recursos de Descanso Consciente</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-start">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3">•</span>
            <span>Acceso a cursos gratuitos</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center justify-start">
            <span class="text-green-500 mr-3">•</span>
            <span>Regalos exclusivos</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-green-600 text-sm">
          Sin spam. Podés cancelar tu suscripción cuando quieras.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Creator Info -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="bg-gradient-green p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl text-white text-center creator-info">
          <p class="mb-2 text-lg"><strong>Creado por:</strong></p>
          <p class="text-xl font-bold">Gimena Galarraga</p>
          <p class="italic opacity-90 mb-2">Psicóloga especializada en mindfulness, compasión y creatividad</p>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-80">
            Basado en los conceptos de la Dr. Saundra Dalton-Smith sobre los 7 tipos de descanso
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Download and Back Links -->
      <div class="text-center mt-8 space-y-4 no-print">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
          <button data-controller="print" data-action="click->print#print" class="px-8 py-3 bg-coral hover:bg-coral/90 text-white rounded-xl font-medium transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg">
            📄 Guardar como PDF
          </button>
          <%= link_to "/cuestionario", class: "inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white rounded-xl font-medium transition-colors duration-200 shadow-lg" do %>
            ← Volver al inicio
          <% end %>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-md mx-auto">
          En el diálogo de impresión, seleccioná "Guardar como PDF" como destino.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
